{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30009_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0b7f774b23309d281397e2310fb183a676be8651b29082fe6f59cf20259a139f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b48344afb9bc3ec428a19f1b832d37d837a81584dd698318f7f07be714ba01d",
      "text": "演戏？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af0cc3ab90eed48a96cca60dbb72f51eff299fd1c7cf2de9aefa498572d1357c",
      "text": "是的。淡化“这是我自己”的意识，\n当成是演戏的一环……把自己当成在扮演恋人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d5683eb06335501e9e47d05dc74847afb65d938d0de5cabec2f03839b16c51d",
      "text": "我觉得这样或许多少能减轻一些抗拒感……\n大家意下如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7f50174152af9c8fcf68f54eda221d8839cdb33c714dbda4ce9341a8cbf3913",
      "text": "原来如此，正因为觉得是自己本人，\n所以有些台词才难以启齿啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d20d8e005a78723e6e2975352eb017d2cb56706989934253a1abda5ba1c9291",
      "text": "我马上试着做做看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2b9f863810ee996b6ca7b088deb34ff7c9d7d585fc4dad8b06996e6ab9cfa19",
      "text": "（……我拍摄的情景是，\n在街头和恋人约会……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0e6f8ed7c86387e055cddcb480d044fcb51c0897dc7cfe3b49c9e141a58c9d6",
      "text": "（中途突然下起了雨，\n伸手护住对方，这种情景……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22d7fc39d634a1f2a3c0dbe6609b48ed8a3f2938730479217d03717a865a1bab",
      "text": "……好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0aec2f529887f276a2f89a9ca914df3d1b8e246bc408d4d55244de383a4dfca1",
      "text": "早上好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000116:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35d3dc4c0848f24351adf4a5806a3390e0304d371b27d2b7d428eab414711b10",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000118:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be1b163d883357ac8615ab481c3a71981fa67da0cc8fc70e5a7c83330b7bc865",
      "text": "现在方便讲两句吗？\n我想向你汇报一下练习的情况。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000120:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79873eb5a661cccbcea968492bf02f49b02737221c118e386d421c0041625e0d",
      "text": "还顺利吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88a91217d3bfcfec6335b6a620ac10e1b2d2d31bd8519f3593fb00eb5060dc0b",
      "text": "勉勉强强吧。\n虽然生硬的地方还是挺多的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49d9fb2ed5f2221cb5c49ef207f78427159caad26cc4ace1274da0677c2047eb",
      "text": "不过，比起最开始已经好上太多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:888eda1aeb4033328b090460ce299b724174f3751effe7a37451c2fcafdadb6d",
      "text": "说判若两人……可能有点夸张，\n但确实大有长进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000129:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60bd5342120378b8c8f4a16ecd100f6c8387b40731b118d1e7c14d26cc266638",
      "text": "这也都多亏了●●●●プロデューサー的\n建议啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000130:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8528efd88e2e83dd6ab4bb5245b9314bc44ac51fbc452cc7e91c04e3c21686b2",
      "text": "托你那个提议的福，总算是找到了努力的方向。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000133:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84e504780de8b72812f269ca821f0f674efb637a8ef88c361ad71d77eee571f6",
      "text": "……哎呀，都这个时间了。\n那就下次开会再聊。到时候拜托你啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
